# ABOUTME: libFuzzer dictionary for Http2ConnectionFuzz: whole operations of its input encoding
# ABOUTME: (requests, DATA, SETTINGS, credit, resets) and raw frame headers, preface and HPACK bytes.
# request: fresh stream, END_STREAM, GET /
"\x00\x00\x01\x00\x00"
# request: fresh stream, body follows, POST /big, content-length 5
"\x00\x00\x00\x09\x01\x00\x01"
# request: split over CONTINUATION frames
"\x00\x00\x30\x01\x00"
# request: padded with priority
"\x00\x00\x06\x01\x00\x03"
# request: expect 100-continue
"\x00\x00\x00\x01\x01\x01\x04"
# DATA on the last stream, END_STREAM, 5 bytes
"\x03\x01\x01\x00\x05"
# DATA, padded
"\x03\x01\x09\x00\x10\x04"
# DATA 16384 bytes
"\x03\x01\x00\x40\x00"
# SETTINGS: initial window 0, max frame 16384, table size 0
"\x04\x00\x01\x04\x00"
"\x04\x00\x01\x05\x06"
"\x04\x00\x01\x01\x00"
# SETTINGS ACK
"\x04\x01\x00"
# WINDOW_UPDATE: connection 1 MiB, last stream 65535, increment 0
"\x05\x03\x05"
"\x05\x01\x04"
"\x05\x01\x00"
# RST_STREAM CANCEL on the last stream
"\x06\x01\x08"
# PRIORITY self-dependent
"\x07\x01\x01\x10\x00"
# PING
"\x08\x00enso-fz!"
# GOAWAY last stream, NO_ERROR
"\x09\x01\x00\x00"
# trailers ending the stream
"\x0e\x01\x00\x01\x0c\x09"
# burst of 20 GETs, each reset
"\x0f\x14\x01"
# raw frame headers: SETTINGS, HEADERS END_HEADERS stream 1, CONTINUATION, DATA
"\x0c\x09\x00\x00\x00\x04\x00\x00\x00\x00\x00"
"\x0c\x09\x00\x00\x00\x01\x04\x00\x00\x00\x01"
"\x0c\x09\x00\x00\x00\x09\x04\x00\x00\x00\x01"
"PRI * HTTP/2.0\x0d\x0a\x0d\x0aSM\x0d\x0a\x0d\x0a"
# HPACK: :method GET, :scheme http, :path /, dynamic table size update 0
"\x82"
"\x86"
"\x84"
"\x20"
